              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kanuka nun kereneari yes kakwap kana alomar akwap namam lem iienete, yes ka lukapapaakus da; kaŋina da ipote aiiaanakin idekesio ice paaran ka kuare da; naarai mam ketodikini yes asianut nepetai da.’",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
