            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Kanuka ŋun, koany, ebala EJAKAIT ebe, Mam bobo ebakai ebe, ‘Kwape eiaria EJAKAIT lokitolomuni idwe luka Isirael kakwap nako Misiri’; ",
          "type": "text",
