          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "konye ebe, ‘Kwape eiaria EJAKAIT lokitolomuni idwe luka Isirael kakwap naka agolitomei, ido kakwapin kere kama erenearit.’ Naarai enyakuni kes akwapukee naabu kainak lukapapaakee.",
